      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thanks, yes this could use some clarification in the docs. An operation as it counts towards the performance ranking includes everything the entire face tracking system might do, including processing standard blendshapes in Blendshapes Sets. An instruction here is part of just the custom expressions mode of Parameter Behaviors (but those instructions also count towards the operations perf rankings). You're correct that there are undocumented limits to prevent abuse: 128 tokens per custom expression, and total of 512 total custom expressions instructions on the avatar.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
